OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 12 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: New Zealand
OL,5,     FComposers
OL,6,     GDonald Macleod explores five
OL,7,     Gclassical composers from the land
OL,8,     Gof the long white cloud, New
OL,9,     GZealand, focusing today on the
OL,10,     Glife and music of John Psathas.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GSarah Walker talks to Tristan
OL,13,     GGurney and Clarence Adoo about
OL,14,     GRNS Moves. Also, Kieran White and
OL,15,     GCedric Meyer perform Dowland live
OL,16,     Gin studio.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,20,     Gfrom Handel, Germaine
OL,21,     GTailleferre, Debussy and Leonard
OL,22,     GBernstein.
