OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 12 MAR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto shares more of the best in
OL,12,     Gjazz, and Iain Ballamy returns to
OL,13,     Gshare his final pick of the week.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GYoung chamber musicians perform a
OL,16,     Gselection of chamber works by
OL,17,     GSchubert in the concert hall of
OL,18,     Gthe Palau de la Musica Catalana
OL,19,     Gin Barcelona. Penny Gore presents.
